stateDiagram-v2
    accTitle: TTT job states
    accDescr: An upload creates a queued job. A worker starts it and it becomes ongoing, moving through parsing, element extraction, tree generation, indexing and persisting, then completes or fails. Cancelling a queued job ends it at once; cancelling an ongoing job passes through cancelling. A failed job can be retried.
    [*] --> QUEUED: POST /v1/documents
    QUEUED --> ONGOING: a worker starts it
    ONGOING --> COMPLETED: result_graph_id is set
    ONGOING --> FAILED
    QUEUED --> CANCELLED: cancel
    ONGOING --> CANCELLING: cancel
    CANCELLING --> CANCELLED
    FAILED --> QUEUED: retry
